Twitter is noisy, but there's real signal in there if you know where to look.

## The problem

Brands and analysts want to understand a conversation, but raw social data is
overwhelming — high volume, low structure, easy to misread.

## What we built

An analytics stack combining NLP topic extraction, sentiment analysis, and
social network analysis to map who is talking, about what, and how they feel —
with a RAG-powered chatbot to dig deeper into the data.

## Results

SociaLabs was selected to represent at APICTA 2024 in Brunei — recognition that
the approach held up against strong regional competition.
